    "effect": "<table>\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <p>Name</p>\n            </td>\n            <td data-colwidth=\"182\">\n                <p>Spirit Cost</p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p>Effect</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <p>Recall</p>\n            </td>\n            <td data-colwidth=\"182\">\n                <p>Varies</p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p>Use any move in the Pokemons Level-Up List. - 1 Spirit for At-Will and EOT, - 2 Spirit for Scene, - 3 Spirit for Daily. This move cannot already be on its move list.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <p>Baton Pass</p>\n            </td>\n            <td data-colwidth=\"182\">\n                <p>3</p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p>When this Pokemon faints, it grants all CS stats to the next Pokemon.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <p>Patched Up</p>\n            </td>\n            <td data-colwidth=\"182\">\n                <p>3</p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p>Recover 50% max HP and 1 Injury (does not count towards limit for the day).</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <p>Stolen Idea</p>\n            </td>\n            <td data-colwidth=\"182\">\n                <p>2</p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p>Use @UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.SbluTZoOqsq2aRD0]{Copycat} or @UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.s6hVuNnG75HkMapT]{Snatch}, ignoring Frequency.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <p>Perfect Skills</p>\n            </td>\n            <td data-colwidth=\"182\">\n                <p>2</p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p>Your next skill check is a max roll.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <p>Intercept+</p>\n            </td>\n            <td data-colwidth=\"182\">\n                <p>1</p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p>You resist the attack you are intercepting 1 step further.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <p>Helping Hand</p>\n            </td>\n            <td data-colwidth=\"182\">\n                <p>1</p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p>Use @UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.xhZNseKRJl3pPnTZ]{Helping Hand} as if it was on your move list, ignoring Frequency and as a Free Action.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>",
